{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 60, :comments ["<b>May you be</b> — היי in gematria is כה, meaning: may you merit that which is stated, \"כה יהיה זרעך\" (so shall your seed be)." "<b>רבבה</b> — four times in the Masorah: היי לאלפי רבבה. ושנים יניסו רבבה. ומאה מכם רבבה ירדופו. רבבה כצמח השדה נתתיך. They said to her that she would be among those of whom it is written, ושנים יניסו רבבה and רבבה כצמח השדה, etc."], :book :genesis, :voice :baal-haturim, :lang :en, :chapter 24, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Kitzur Baal HaTurim" "http://sefaria.org"] ["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-12T19:16:51.817588441Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}